<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIJMANS PLANS SHARE SPLIT.</title>
<headline>HEIJMANS PLANS SHARE SPLIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Heijmans NV said on Tuesday it was planning a share split on the basis of five new shares on the basis of every one currently held.</p>
<p>The company made the announcement at its annual general meeting.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement its shares will be traded with the new value on the Amsterdam stock exchange from October 4.</p>
<p>Heijmans shares closed at 135.50 guilders on Tuesday, off 7.30 guilders from Mondays close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
